   "rendered": "Fall/Winter Adult Open Gym Sessions"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "<div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #222; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; margin-bottom: 40px;\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.austinvelocity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-3-scaled.png\" alt=\"Adults playing indoor volleyball at Austin Velocity\" /></p>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 40px; left: 40px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding: 25px 30px; border-radius: 12px; color: white;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 42px; color: white;\">FALL/WINTER ADULT OPEN GYM</h1>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 18px;\">Sundays &bull; 5PM&ndash;8PM &bull; Indoor Open Play</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-size: 18px;\">Season Dates: November 15, 2026 &ndash; January 17, 2027</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto;\">Eight Sunday evenings of competitive adult volleyball at The Crossover. Buy the season pass or drop in for a single night. Ages 17 and up.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 250px; background: #f7f7f7; padding: 30px; border-radius: 14px;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">LOCATION</h2>\n<p><strong>The Crossover</strong><br />1717 Scottsdale Dr<br />Cedar Park, TX 78641</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 250px; background: #f7f7f7; padding: 30px; border-radius: 14px;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">SESSION DATES</h2>\n<p>November 15 &amp; 22<br />December 6, 13, 20 &amp; 27<br />January 3 &amp; 17<br />Sundays, 5:00&ndash;8:00PM</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 25px; margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 300px; background: #fafafa; padding: 35px; border-radius: 14px; border-top: 6px solid #00bcd4;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">8-SESSION PASS</h2>\n<p><strong>$40</strong> with code OPENPLAY40, through November 15</p>\n<p><strong>$50</strong> from November 16</p>\n<p><strong>Covers all eight Sundays</strong></p>\n<p>The best value if you plan to play most weeks. After checkout you will receive a code by email &mdash; use it to reserve your spot for each date. Pass sales close December 10.</p>\n<p><a style=\"display: inline-block; background: #00bcd4; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px;\" href=\"https://app.acuityscheduling.com/catalog.php?owner=19750684&amp;action=addCart&amp;clear=1&amp;id=2306424\">Buy the Season Pass</a></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 300px; background: #fafafa; padding: 35px; border-radius: 14px; border-top: 6px solid #ff4081;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">SINGLE SESSION</h2>\n<p><strong>$10</strong> reserved online in advance</p>\n<p><strong>$12</strong> at the door</p>\n<p><strong>Any Sunday on the schedule</strong></p>\n<p>Drop in for one night. Space is capped at 42 players per session, so booking ahead is the safest way to get on a court.</p>\n<p><a style=\"display: inline-block; background: #ff4081; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px;\" href=\"https://app.acuityscheduling.com/schedule.php?owner=19750684&amp;appointmentType=99989782\">Book a Single Session</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #111; color: white; padding: 40px; border-radius: 14px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; color: white;\">GOOD TO KNOW</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Players must be 17 or older. This is competitive, self-called play &mdash; no referees, so call your own net violations and lifts. Please check in at the table or whiteboard when you arrive, and treat the facility as if it were your own.</p>\n<p><a style=\"display: inline-block; background: #ff4081; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/austinvelocityadults/\">Follow @AustinVelocityAdults</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
  }
 },
