  "content": {
   "rendered": "<div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #222; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; margin-bottom: 40px;\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.austinvelocity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-3-scaled.png\" alt=\"Adults playing indoor volleyball at Austin Velocity\" /></p>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 40px; left: 40px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding: 25px 30px; border-radius: 12px; color: white;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 42px; color: white;\">ADULT VOLLEYBALL</h1>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 18px;\">Open gym and open play for ages 17 and up</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-size: 18px;\">The Crossover &bull; Cedar Park, TX</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto;\">Austin Velocity opens its courts to adults throughout the year. Whether you are getting back into the game or looking for high-level competition, there is a night for you.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fafafa; padding: 35px; border-radius: 14px; border-top: 6px solid #00bcd4; margin-bottom: 50px; text-align: center;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #00838f;\"><strong>NOW BOOKING</strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">FALL/WINTER ADULT OPEN GYM</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Sundays &bull; 5PM&ndash;8PM &bull; November 15, 2026 &ndash; January 17, 2027</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;\">Eight Sunday evenings of competitive indoor volleyball. Buy the season pass for all eight nights, or drop in for a single session.</p>\n<p><a style=\"display: inline-block; background: #00bcd4; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px;\" href=\"https://www.austinvelocity.com/rentals/fall-winter-adult-open-gym\">See Dates &amp; Pricing</a></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 250px; background: #f7f7f7; padding: 30px; border-radius: 14px;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">LOCATION</h2>\n<p><strong>The Crossover</strong><br />1717 Scottsdale Dr<br />Cedar Park, TX 78641</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 250px; background: #f7f7f7; padding: 30px; border-radius: 14px;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">WHAT TO EXPECT</h2>\n<p>Players 17 and up<br />Competitive, self-called play<br />No referees &mdash; call your own net violations and lifts<br />Check in at the table when you arrive</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #111; color: white; padding: 40px; border-radius: 14px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; color: white;\">STAY UPDATED</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Follow us on Instagram for schedule updates, announcements, and open play information.</p>\n<p><a style=\"display: inline-block; background: #ff4081; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/austinvelocityadults/\">Follow @AustinVelocityAdults</a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px; margin-top: 28px;\">Join the Adult Volleyball GroupMe chat to connect with other players and get night-of updates.</p>\n<p><a style=\"display: inline-block; background: #00bcd4; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px;\" href=\"https://groupme.com/join_group/redacted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Join the GroupMe Chat</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
  }
 }
